  "body_html": "<p>Bring the vibrant beauty of the desert into your home with the Jeminise Cactus &amp; Floral Quilt Set. This stunning quilt bedspread features a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors, perfect for adding a touch of nature-inspired elegance and cheerful energy to any bedroom.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Design:</strong> Showcases a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors for a pop of nature-inspired beauty.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt set by selecting your preferred size, adding pillowcases, or including your name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available in Multiple Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift Idea:</strong> A unique and thoughtful gift for cactus lovers, home décor enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates vibrant and cheerful bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this quilt set is machine washable for easy cleaning and low-maintenance upkeep.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor use, providing warmth in all seasons, ideal for beds, sofas, picnics, and camping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Quality Material:</strong> Features a breathable soft fabric outer layer and high-quality silk floss filling for comfortable use.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Style #10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cactus, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Cactus, Desert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
